004100 LINKAGE SECTION.
004200 01  SP-AREA.
004300     03  SP-SIME                 PIC 9(02).
004400     03  SP-YM                   PIC 9(06).
004500     03  SP-FROM                 PIC 9(08).
004600     03  SP-TO                   PIC 9(08).
004700     03  SP-TO-R REDEFINES SP-TO.
004800         05  SP-TO-YM            PIC 9(06).
004900         05  SP-TO-DD            PIC 9(02).
005000     03  SP-RC                   PIC 9(02).
005100 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING SP-AREA.
005200 S000.
005300     MOVE ZERO   TO SP-RC SP-FROM SP-TO.
005400     MOVE SP-YM  TO WK-YM.
005500     IF WK-MM < 1 OR WK-MM > 12
005600        MOVE 9 TO SP-RC
005700        GO TO S999.
005800     IF SP-SIME = 99
005900        GO TO S100.
006000     IF SP-SIME < 1 OR SP-SIME > 28
006100        MOVE 9 TO SP-RC
006200        GO TO S999.
006300     PERFORM S500 THRU S500-EXIT.
006400     GO TO S200.
006500*
006600*    末日締め
006700 S100.
006800     MOVE WK-MM       TO A4.
006900     MOVE WK-YYYY     TO WK-Y4.
007000     MOVE WK-MM       TO WK-M2.
007100     MOVE 01          TO WK-D2.
007200     MOVE WK-YMD      TO SP-FROM.
007300     MOVE MATU-DD(A4) TO WK-D2.
007400     MOVE WK-YMD      TO SP-TO.
007500     GO TO S999.
007600*
007700*    ＮＮ日締め（前月ＮＮ＋１日～当月ＮＮ日）
007800 S200.
007900     MOVE WK-ZYYYY    TO WK-Y4.
008000     MOVE WK-ZMM      TO WK-M2.
008100     COMPUTE WK-D2 = SP-SIME + 1.
008200     MOVE WK-YMD      TO SP-FROM.
008300     MOVE WK-YYYY     TO WK-Y4.
008400     MOVE WK-MM       TO WK-M2.
008500     MOVE SP-SIME     TO WK-D2.
008600     MOVE WK-YMD      TO SP-TO.
008700*
008800* 2008.02 改修 田中 うるう年の２月末日補正
008900 S300.
009000     MOVE WK-YYYY TO WK-X1.
009100     DIVIDE WK-X1 BY 4 GIVING WK-X1 REMAINDER WK-X2.
009200     IF WK-X2 = 0 AND WK-MM = 02 AND SP-TO-DD = 28
009300        MOVE 29 TO SP-TO-DD.
009400     GO TO S999.
009500*
009600*    前月算出
009700 S500.
009800     IF WK-MM = 01
009900        COMPUTE WK-ZYYYY = WK-YYYY - 1
010000        MOVE 12 TO WK-ZMM
010100     ELSE
010200        MOVE WK-YYYY TO WK-ZYYYY
010300        COMPUTE WK-ZMM = WK-MM - 1.
010400 S500-EXIT.
010500     EXIT.
010600*
010700 S999.
010800     EXIT PROGRAM.
